cut-off for cell differences; a defaulted SE would have printed a silent `± 0.0000`), 2 rejected with reasons, 1 deferred.\n\n**PR:** https://github.com/jamesponwith/spotify-recsys-ecosystem/pull/6 — not merged; bead left open. Reservations released.\n\n**Filed:** `spot-w7a` (blocked on `spot-ktp`) — `EVALUATION.md`'s prose quotes a pre-seed-fix run (0.1422 …) and now disagrees with the regenerated tables beneath it. Rewriting the narrative is a different idea from printing the bands, so I left it out deliberately.\n\n**Left in place:** this worktree (`…-spot-ktp`) — the spawner created it and is running me from inside it, so removing it is its call, not mine. The `pr_opened` audit line is in the out-of-tree mirror.","ttft_ms":2329,"type":"result","duration_ms":841295,"uuid":"21c4015e-6ae2-4733-acc5-248b8413e517","ttft_stream_ms":1601,"time_to_request_ms":173,"queued_turn_count":0}
